#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Similar to the [Sampler](/guides/get-started-with-sampler) primitive, Executor samples output registers from quantum circuit executions, but it does not have any built in error suppression or mitigation. Instead, it's part of the [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model) that provides the ingredients to capture design intents on the client side, and shifts the costly generation of circuit variants to the server side. Executor follows the directives provided in circuit annotations and options, generates and binds parameter values, executes the bound circuits on the hardware, and returns the execution results and metadata. It does not make any implicit decisions for you and gives you full control and transparency.\n"
msgstr "Mirip dengan primitif [Sampler](/guides/get-started-with-sampler), Executor mengambil sampel register output dari eksekusi quantum circuit, tapi tidak memiliki error suppression atau mitigasi bawaan. Sebagai gantinya, ini adalah bagian dari [model eksekusi terarah](/guides/directed-execution-model) yang menyediakan bahan-bahan untuk menangkap niat desain di sisi klien, dan memindahkan pembuatan varian circuit yang mahal ke sisi server. Executor mengikuti direktif yang diberikan dalam anotasi dan opsi circuit, menghasilkan dan mengikat nilai parameter, mengeksekusi circuit yang terikat pada hardware, dan mengembalikan hasil eksekusi beserta metadata. Ia tidak membuat keputusan implisit apapun untukmu dan memberimu kontrol penuh serta transparansi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The Qiskit package does not yet have a base class for the Executor primitive.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Paket Qiskit belum memiliki kelas dasar untuk primitif Executor.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Sebelum kamu mulai {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some of the code examples on this page use `samplex`, which is part of the Samplomatic package.  Therefore, before running those code block, you must install Samplomatic, as shown in the following code block.  For more information, see the [Samplomatic documentation](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic).\n"
msgstr "Beberapa contoh kode di halaman ini menggunakan `samplex`, yang merupakan bagian dari paket Samplomatic. Karena itu, sebelum menjalankan blok kode tersebut, kamu harus menginstal Samplomatic, seperti yang ditunjukkan di blok kode berikut. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat [dokumentasi Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Steps to use the Executor primitive {#steps-to-use-the-executor-primitive}"
msgstr "Langkah-langkah menggunakan primitif Executor {#steps-to-use-the-executor-primitive}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Initialize the account {#1-initialize-the-account}"
msgstr "1. Inisialisasi akun {#1-initialize-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because IBM Quantum Compute Service is a managed service, you first need to initialize your account. You can then select the QPU you want to use to calculate the expectation value.\n"
msgstr "Karena IBM Quantum Compute Service adalah layanan terkelola, kamu perlu menginisialisasi akunmu terlebih dahulu. Kamu kemudian bisa memilih QPU yang ingin digunakan untuk menghitung nilai ekspektasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow the steps in the [Set up your IBM Cloud&reg; account](/guides/cloud-setup) if you don't already have an account.\n"
msgstr "Ikuti langkah-langkah di [Siapkan akun IBM Cloud&reg;-mu](/guides/cloud-setup) jika kamu belum punya akun.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Create and transpile a circuit {#2-create-and-transpile-a-circuit}"
msgstr "2. Buat dan transpile circuit {#2-create-and-transpile-a-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You need at least one circuit to use the Executor primitive.  It can optionally have parameters.\n"
msgstr "Kamu butuh setidaknya satu circuit untuk menggunakan primitif Executor. Circuit bisa secara opsional memiliki parameter.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The circuit needs to be transformed to only use instructions supported by the QPU (referred to as *instruction set architecture (ISA)* circuits). Use the transpiler to do this.\n"
msgstr "Circuit perlu diubah agar hanya menggunakan instruksi yang didukung QPU (disebut circuit *instruction set architecture (ISA)*). Gunakan transpiler untuk melakukan ini.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Initialize a `QuantumProgram` {#3-initialize-a-quantumprogram}"
msgstr "3. Inisialisasi `QuantumProgram` {#3-initialize-a-quantumprogram}"

# doq: emptied 2026-09-05, previous translation failed check.py
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize a `QuantumProgram` with your workload. A `QuantumProgram` is made up of `QuantumProgramItems`. Typically, each item consists of a circuit, a set of parameter values, and possibly a `samplex` to randomize the circuit content. For full details, see [Executor inputs and outputs](/guides/executor-input-output).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following cell initializes a `QuantumProgram` and specifies to perform 25 shots. Next, it appends the transpiled target circuit.\n"
msgstr "Sel berikut menginisialisasi `QuantumProgram` dan menentukan untuk melakukan 25 shot. Selanjutnya, ia menambahkan circuit target yang sudah ditranspile.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Optional: Group gates and measurements into annotated boxes {#4-optional-group-gates-and-measurements-into-annotated-boxes}"
msgstr "4. Opsional: Kelompokkan gate dan pengukuran ke dalam kotak beranotasi {#4-optional-group-gates-and-measurements-into-annotated-boxes}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Grouping instructions into boxes and annotating them is the primary way to specify your intent. In the following example, we use `generate_boxing_pass_manager` and its twirling parameters to group two-qubit gates and measurements into boxes and apply twirling annotation.\n"
msgstr "Mengelompokkan instruksi ke dalam kotak dan memberikan anotasi adalah cara utama untuk menentukan niatmu. Dalam contoh berikut, kita menggunakan `generate_boxing_pass_manager` dan parameter twirling-nya untuk mengelompokkan gate dua-qubit dan pengukuran ke dalam kotak serta menerapkan anotasi twirling.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/get-started-with-executor/extracted-outputs/245a4574-3ce9-4f77-98c8-af32cde8ac01-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/get-started-with-executor/extracted-outputs/245a4574-3ce9-4f77-98c8-af32cde8ac01-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Optional: Build a template circuit and samplex, and add them to the program {#5-optional-build-a-template-circuit-and-samplex-and-add-them-to-the-program}"
msgstr "5. Opsional: Buat template circuit dan samplex, lalu tambahkan ke program {#5-optional-build-a-template-circuit-and-samplex-and-add-them-to-the-program}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, use the Samplomatic [build](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/api/auto/samplomatic.build.html#samplomatic.build) method to generate the _template circuit_ and _samplex_ pair. The template circuit is structurally equivalent to the original circuit. However, its single-qubit gates are replaced by parameterized gates in order to implement the prescribed annotations (gate and measurement twirling, in this example). The samplex encodes all the information required to generate randomized parameters for the template circuit.\n"
msgstr "Selanjutnya, gunakan metode [build](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/api/auto/samplomatic.build.html#samplomatic.build) Samplomatic untuk menghasilkan pasangan _template circuit_ dan _samplex_. Template circuit secara struktural setara dengan circuit asli. Namun, gate single-qubit-nya digantikan oleh gate yang diparameterisasi untuk mengimplementasikan anotasi yang ditentukan (gate dan measurement twirling, dalam contoh ini). Samplex mengkodekan semua informasi yang diperlukan untuk menghasilkan parameter acak bagi template circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After generating the template circuit and samplex pair, use the `append_samplex_item` method to add the pair to the program.\n"
msgstr "Setelah menghasilkan pasangan template circuit dan samplex, gunakan metode `append_samplex_item` untuk menambahkan pasangan tersebut ke program.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the Samplomatic [API](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/api/index.html) documentation for full details about `samplomatic.samplex.Samplex` and its arguments.\n"
msgstr "Lihat dokumentasi [API](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/api/index.html) Samplomatic untuk detail lengkap tentang `samplomatic.samplex.Samplex` dan argumen-argumennya.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "6. Invoke Executor and get results {#6-invoke-executor-and-get-results}"
msgstr "6. Jalankan Executor dan dapatkan hasil {#6-invoke-executor-and-get-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the `QuantumProgram` on an IBM&reg; backend by using the `Executor` primitive with default options. See [Executor options](/guides/executor-options) to learn about the available options.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan `QuantumProgram` pada backend IBM&reg; menggunakan primitif `Executor` dengan opsi default. Lihat [Opsi Executor](/guides/executor-options) untuk mempelajari opsi yang tersedia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The result is of type [`QuantumProgramResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-quantum-program-result). See [Executor input and output](/guides/executor-input-output) to learn about the result object.\n"
msgstr "Hasilnya bertipe [`QuantumProgramResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-quantum-program-result). Lihat [Input dan output Executor](/guides/executor-input-output) untuk mempelajari tentang objek hasil.\n"

